You attacked the despicable man, squeezed his throat, and threatened him:
"If you don't lift this damn curse, I will kill you!"
At first the scoundrel tried to unclench your arms, and then punched your injured side. You bent from the pain. Then he kicked your bad leg. You fell on the floor. There were some things lying on the floor. Among them you spotted a paper knife. While pretending to be trying to crawl out of the room, you secretly took it. The bastard blocked your way, and said, bending down to your face,
"No, I will kill you!"
At that moment you stabbed him. After getting the upper hand, being injured and tired, you left that dreadful house.
You waited for the next night with trepidation, but your fears were for naught. Never again did you transform into a wolf.